{"words": [{"text": "فَوَسْوَسَ", "translation": "Then whispered"}, {"text": "لَهُمَا", "translation": "to both of them"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ", "translation": "the Shaitaan"}, {"text": "لِيُبْدِىَ", "translation": "to make apparent"}, {"text": "لَهُمَا", "translation": "to both of them"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "وُۥرِىَ", "translation": "was concealed"}, {"text": "عَنْهُمَا", "translation": "from both of them"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "سَوْءَٰتِهِمَا", "translation": "their shame"}, {"text": "وَقَالَ", "translation": "And he said"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "(Did) not"}, {"text": "نَهَىٰكُمَا", "translation": "forbid you both"}, {"text": "رَبُّكُمَا", "translation": "your Lord"}, {"text": "عَنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "هَـٰذِهِ", "translation": "this"}, {"text": "ٱلشَّجَرَةِ", "translation": "[the] tree"}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "translation": "except"}, {"text": "أَن", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "تَكُونَا", "translation": "you two become"}, {"text": "مَلَكَيْنِ", "translation": "Angels"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "تَكُونَا", "translation": "you two become"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْخَـٰلِدِينَ", "translation": "the immortals"}], "sahih": "But Satan whispered to them to make apparent to them that which was concealed from them of their private parts. He said, \"Your Lord did not forbid you this tree except that you become angels or become of the immortal.\""}